---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Practical File Conversion Guides | FilePebble" description="Step-by-step tutorials for comparing CSV exports, merging and splitting PDFs, compressing images, converting Markdown, and preparing JSON for spreadsheets.">
  <article class="prose-page wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">LEARN BY EXAMPLE</div><h1>Practical file guides</h1>
    <p>Real file-processing tasks are easier to complete when you know what an output should contain and what can go wrong. These guides explain the steps, provide concrete examples and document common limitations of FilePebble's browser-based tools.</p>
    <ul class="guides-list"><li><a href="/guides/compare-csv-files-by-id/">Compare CSV exports by unique ID</a><p>Match moved rows and identify changed records</p></li>
<li><a href="/guides/merge-pdf-files-in-order/">Merge PDF files in the right order</a><p>Combine reports and supporting documents</p></li>
<li><a href="/guides/compress-images-for-email/">Compress images for email</a><p>Balance file size against image quality</p></li>
<li><a href="/guides/markdown-to-pdf-print-guide/">Turn Markdown into a PDF</a><p>Fix print margins, tables and code formatting</p></li>
<li><a href="/guides/json-to-csv-spreadsheet-guide/">Convert JSON safely to CSV</a><p>Protect IDs, optional fields and nested values</p></li>
<li><a href="/guides/split-pdf-selected-pages/">Split a PDF by selected page ranges</a><p>Export PDFs or ZIP files from page selections</p></li></ul>
    <p>Need a different workflow? <a href="/#tools">Browse all tools</a> or <a href="/contact/">suggest a topic</a>.</p>
  </article>
  <style>.guides-list{list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:15px}.guides-list li{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:20px;background:#fffefa}.guides-list li a{font-size:16px;font-weight:500}.guides-list li p{margin:9px 0 0}@media(max-width:650px){.guides-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
</Layout>
